@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Alert Preferences" as SAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Update Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: Access Investment Opportunities" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Receive Portfolio News" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: Manage Relationship with Advisors" as CFR009

  SysAdmin --> SAFR002 : Configure system parameters for alerts and recommendations.
  
  Client --> (CFR001, CFR003, CFR004, CFR005, CFR006, CFR007, CFR008, CFR009) 
    : View dashboards, predictions, recommendations, update preferences, etc.

  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR002: Manage client mentoring sessions based on system-generated insights.
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR003: View predictive analytics about clients' financial situations.
  
  SystemAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters for the AI system ensuring compliance with regulations like Basel III.

  Client <|-- (CFR002, CFR006) 
    : Receive alerts and view spending limit alerts when exceeding thresholds.

  FinancialAdvisor <|-- FAFR004: Configure analysis parameters specific to client segments.
  
}

@enduml